{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfWctvBnVFg1zo3Y8pg5q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01PKYULLUAeEbtY3q3DGiwra","name":"StructuredOutput","input":{"interpretation":"This mapping updates the previous one after one new admitted observation: the Testing re-measurement (56805fe3…).\n\n**What the re-measurement shows.** It ran the two fixed commands against the corrected CLI (sha256:fe8f4080…). Every selected file is current and none is stale.\n- Command 0 (`node generated/hello-world.mjs`) exited 0 with no signal or timeout. It printed exactly \"Hello, world!\\n\" (14 bytes), and stderr was empty.\n- Command 1 (`node --test test/component/hello-cli.test.mjs test/uat/hello-cli.uat.test.mjs`) exited 0 with tests 2, pass 2 and fail 0. Stderr was empty.\n- The supplied component and UAT tests are unchanged, and both spawn the real CLI with process.execPath.\n\n**Revision lineage now in place.** The chain has three linked parts:\n- the baseline failure (7d8d…), which stays historical evidence about the earlier bytes 6476…;\n- the Construction correction (1f11…);\n- this re-measurement of the current subject (56805fe3…).\n\n**Behavior and revision.** Realization and verifier execution are now present for both obligations. Each still needs an independent semantic assessment before it can close.\n\n**Still missing.** The four authored assets are absent from the worksite: specification/project-conformance.md, design/implementation-design.md, design/test-design.md and test-execution-plan.json. Conformance, implementation-design, test-design and execution-plan therefore have no realization. Complete-original stays open.\n\n**Remaining steps.** The CLI and tests will not change, so the re-measurement stays current and is reused as evidence without re-running it. What remains is:\n1. Specification, which is the authority for design under the original stage order.\n2. Design.\n3. Independent UAT over all obligations.\n\n**Execution receipt.** The original test_execution_result meaning (exit 0, observed passes at least the expected passes, plan satisfied) is carried by the admitted C2 evidence plus UAT. It is not carried by a handwritten test-execution-result.json, which is outside the admitted write scope.\n\n**Status:** no obligation is closed yet, and no application success is established.","contributions":[{"graphFunctionRef":"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/specification@5","contribution":"Write only specification/project-conformance.md. It must declare the minimal CLI Hello World software-build traversal and state:\n- **Intent**\n- **Product boundary:** a Node CLI with no package install or network dependency.\n- **Source-grounded requirements:** the source surface is generated/hello-world.mjs, and the execution proof runs the CLI and observes stdout exactly \"Hello, world!\\n\" with exit 0.\n- **Completion criteria:** component and UAT tests execute the real CLI, with at least 2 passes and 0 failures; the execution plan agrees with the two fixed commands.\n\nDo not write source, tests, package files or execution plans.","reason":"The conformance asset is absent and must come from fresh native work. Under the original conformance_project stage, it is the authority for implementation design, so it comes first among the remaining authored assets. The current admitted CLI behavior (56805fe3…) and the preserved baseline (7d8d…) are context only. The requirements come from the original source and oracle.","supportRefs":["obligation://default-library-witness/conformance@5","obligation://default-library-witness/complete-original@5"],"evidenceRefs":["task://default-library-witness/s6-original@5","worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/9d4e7f30ffd1db725858c76dbdb4626145991367cb705f606b2b79e6a4ee049a","result://abiogenesis/56805fe3c08b6090c1bd5f5732dae0052e14fdabf28488db3725f1ab2277704b"],"dependsOn":[]},{"graphFunctionRef":"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/design@5","contribution":"Using the written conformance asset as authority, write three files.\n\n**design/implementation-design.md**\n- A minimal Node CLI at generated/hello-world.mjs that prints exactly \"Hello, world!\" plus one newline, with no package install.\n- Name the component and UAT test surfaces that execute the CLI and assert its stdout.\n\n**design/test-design.md**\n- Component and UAT validation of the stdout contract.\n- Both tests spawn node generated/hello-world.mjs and assert status 0 and stdout exactly \"Hello, world!\\n\", matching the supplied test files.\n\n**test-execution-plan.json**\n- command: node\n- args: [\"--test\",\"test/component/hello-cli.test.mjs\",\"test/uat/hello-cli.uat.test.mjs\"]\n- expectedTestPassCount: at least 2\n- expectedStdoutMatch: includes \"fail 0\", with no exact pass-count fragment\n- assertedReturnValue: \"Hello, world!\"\n\nDo not write test-execution-result.json. The admitted C2 evidence carries the execution-result meaning.","reason":"All three assets are absent and must be freshly written. The original implementation_design stage takes the conformance artifact as authority. The test design must match the real supplied test surfaces. The plan must agree with the fixed commands and the original expectations, and it does not control execution.","supportRefs":["obligation://default-library-witness/implementation-design@5","obligation://default-library-witness/test-design@5","obligation://default-library-witness/execution-plan@5","obligation://default-library-witness/complete-original@5"],"evidenceRefs":["task://default-library-witness/s6-original@5","worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/9d4e7f30ffd1db725858c76dbdb4626145991367cb705f606b2b79e6a4ee049a","result://abiogenesis/56805fe3c08b6090c1bd5f5732dae0052e14fdabf28488db3725f1ab2277704b"],"dependsOn":["graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/specification@5"]},{"graphFunctionRef":"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/uat@5","contribution":"Independently assess the full original outcome.\n\n**Inputs:**\n- the original source, the witness contract and the oracle rubric\n- the exact corrected CLI (fe8f4080…)\n- the four written assets\n- the current admitted C2 re-measurement (56805fe3…)\n\n**Cover:**\n- the written content and how it corresponds to the source and to predecessor assets\n- verifier adequacy: both supplied tests execute the real CLI\n- how the plan corresponds to the fixed commands and to the observed pass/fail result\n- the consequential revision chain: baseline failure 7d8d… on the old bytes, then correction 1f11…, then passing re-measurement 56805fe3… on the current bytes\n\nPreserve any unmet or indeterminate criteria.","reason":"Parent completion needs an independent semantic assessment by a distinct actor, over exact current evidence, for every obligation. Completed children, file presence, stage counts and author reports cannot substitute for it.","supportRefs":["obligation://default-library-witness/complete-original@5","obligation://default-library-witness/conformance@5","obligation://default-library-witness/implementation-design@5","obligation://default-library-witness/test-design@5","obligation://default-library-witness/execution-plan@5","obligation://default-library-witness/behavior@5","obligation://default-library-witness/revision@5"],"evidenceRefs":["task://default-library-witness/s6-original@5","result://abiogenesis/7d8d7f5fb42032f75ae9dc9e25aa3ca1583a3d2977bb54dece7f63130970ab02","result://abiogenesis/1f11cf4c619b59bf0b318df4eb5484ed751e9fae66e612c16ce8f9c2b252ec83","result://abiogenesis/56805fe3c08b6090c1bd5f5732dae0052e14fdabf28488db3725f1ab2277704b"],"dependsOn":["graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/specification@5","graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/design@5"]}],"gaps":[],"nextGraphFunctionRef":"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/specification@5","nextReason":"The steel thread is now end-to-end on the current bytes: an admit